   "title": "Feel the surface landmarks",
   "view": "specimen",
   "text": "Before cutting, find the landmarks on the skin: the suprasternal notch, the sternal angle (level of the second costal cartilage), the clavicle along its length, the acromion, the coracoid process deep in the infraclavicular fossa, the deltopectoral groove and the two axillary folds.",
