   "act": "Make the incisions",
   "set": {
    "inc": 1
   },
   "text": "Cut through the skin only. First, a midline cut from the suprasternal notch to the xiphoid process. Second, along the clavicle to the acromion. Third, from the xiphoid process round the chest to the posterior axillary line. Fourth, from the acromion down the front of the arm to its middle.",
